  "description": {
    "raw": "A 4-foot-long, blazing, forked bolt of electricity springs forth from your hand. You wield this spear-like bolt as if it were a trident (you are considered proficient with the bolt). Attacks with Gozreh’s trident are melee touch attacks. The bolt deals 1d8 points of electricity damage + 1 point per 2 caster levels (maximum +10). Since the bolt is immaterial, your Strength modifier does not apply to the damage. The bolt can ignite combustible materials such as parchment, straw, dry sticks, and cloth.",
    "search_text": "\"a 4-foot-long, blazing, forked bolt of electricity springs forth from your hand. you wield this spear-like bolt as if it were a trident (you are considered proficient with the bolt). attacks with gozreh’s trident are melee touch attacks. the bolt deals 1d8 points of electricity damage + 1 point per 2 caster levels (maximum +10). since the bolt is immaterial, your strength modifier does not apply to the damage. the bolt can ignite combustible materials such as parchment, straw, dry sticks, and cloth.\"",
